@host = http://localhost:8098

### 1) Upload trusted text source
POST {{host}}/api/documents/sources
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=demo

--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Incident response runbook
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tenantId"

tenant-acme
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="visibility"

internal
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="incident-runbook.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Rotate impacted credentials, notify the customer success owner, and preserve audit evidence.
--demo--

### 2) Preview chunks before enqueueing work
GET {{host}}/api/documents/sources/{{sourceId}}/preview

### 3) Queue indexing work and persist chunk manifest
POST {{host}}/api/documents/sources/{{sourceId}}/index

### 4) Replace source content before reindexing
PUT {{host}}/api/documents/sources/{{sourceId}}/content
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=demo

--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Incident response runbook v2
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tenantId"

tenant-acme
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="visibility"

internal
--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="incident-runbook.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Rotate impacted credentials, notify customer success, preserve audit evidence, and open a follow-up task.
--demo--

### 5) Reindex replacement; old chunks are deleted first
POST {{host}}/api/documents/sources/{{sourceId}}/index

### 6) Delete source vectors and manifest entries
DELETE {{host}}/api/documents/sources/{{sourceId}}

### 7) Safety path: unsupported file extension is rejected
POST {{host}}/api/documents/sources
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=demo

--demo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="unsafe.exe"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

not a trusted document
--demo--
